# Backup grants the ability Voldaren Thrillseeker's card prints (CR 702.165a, 702.165d), whatever the object its
# trigger resolves for has become. High Fae Trickster lets Bot1 cast spells as though they had flash (CR 702.8a): with
# backup 2 on the stack targeting the Trickster, Bot1 casts Cubwarden for its mutate cost over the Thrillseeker, on top
# (CR 702.140c), so the merged creature is a Cubwarden with the Thrillseeker's abilities too (CR 702.140e). Backup then
# gives the Trickster two +1/+1 counters and "{1}, Sacrifice this creature: It deals damage equal to its power to any
# target", and the Trickster, 6/4, sacrifices itself for 6 to Bot2.

